msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_Pixel_Brush_Settings_Mirror.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:39
msgid "This allows you to mirror the Brush tip with Sensors."
msgstr "Tako lahko konico čopiča zrcalite s tipali."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:41
msgid "Horizontal"
msgstr "Vodoravno"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:42
msgid "Mirrors the mask horizontally."
msgstr "Zrcali masko vodoravno."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:44
msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "Navpično"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:44
msgid "Mirrors the mask vertically."
msgstr "Zrcali masko navpično."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:47
msgid ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_2_9_brushengine_mirror.jpg"
msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_2_9_brushengine_mirror.jpg"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:48
msgid ""
"Some examples of mirroring and using it in combination with :ref:"
"`option_rotation`."
msgstr ""
"Nekateri primeri zrcaljenja in uporabe v kombinaciji z :ref:"
"`option_rotation`."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:53
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "Vrtenje"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:55
msgid "This allows you to affect Angle of your brush tip with Sensors."
msgstr "Tako lahko s tipali vplivate na jot konice čopiča."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:58
msgid ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_2_9_brushengine_rotation.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_2_9_brushengine_rotation.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:60
msgid ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_Pixel_Brush_Settings_Rotation.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_Pixel_Brush_Settings_Rotation.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:61
msgid "In the above example, several applications of the parameter."
msgstr "V zgornjem primeru je več aplikacij parametra."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:63
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Drawing Angle -- A common one, usually used in combination with rake-type "
"brushes. Especially effect because it does not rely on tablet-specific "
"sensors. Sometimes, Tilt-Direction or Rotation is used to achieve a similar-"
"more tablet focused effect, where with Tilt the 0° is at 12 o'clock, Drawing "
"angle uses 3 o'clock as 0°."
msgstr ""
"Risalni kot -- Običajen, ki se običajno uporablja v kombinaciji s čopiči za "
"rake tipa. Še posebej učinek, ker se ne zanaša na senzorje specifične za "
"tablete. Včasih se za doseganje podobno bolj usmerjenega učinka na tablični "
"računalnik uporablja smer nagiba ali vrtenja, kjer je nagib 0° ob 12. uri, "
"kot risbe uporablja 3 ure kot 0°."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:64
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Fuzzy -- Also very common, this gives a nice bit of randomness for texture."
msgstr "Fuzzy -- Tudi zelo pogosto, to daje lep del naključnosti za teksturo."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:65
msgid ""
"Distance -- With careful editing of the Sensor curve, you can create nice "
"patterns."
msgstr ""
"Razdalja -- S skrbnim urejanjem krivulje tipala lahko ustvarite lepe vzorce."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:66
#, fuzzy
msgid "Fade -- This slowly fades the rotation from one into another."
msgstr "To počasi zbledi iz ene v drugo."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:67
msgid ""
"Pressure -- An interesting one that can create an alternative looking line."
msgstr "Pritisk -- zanimiv, lahko ustvari alternativno črto."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:72
msgid "Lightness Strength"
msgstr "Moč svetlosti"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:73
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This allows you to affect the Lightness Strength of your brush tip with "
"Sensors. Only available with brush tips in Lightness Map mode."
msgstr ""
"To vam omogoča, da vplivate na moč svetlobe vaše konice čopiča s Senzorji. "
"Na voljo samo s nasveti za krtačo v načinu Lightness Map."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:77
msgid ".. image:: images/brushes/lightness_strength_demo.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/lightness_strength_demo.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:78
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This changes the contrast of the brush tip, so that at 100%, the full effect "
"of the lightness variation is visible in the brush, while at 0% the brush "
"paints without any lightness variation.  This allows a variable impasto "
"effect with lightness brushes, and for variation in texture stamp brushes "
"that use a lightness-enabled brush tip."
msgstr ""
"S tem se spremeni kontrast konice čopiča, tako da je pri 100%, poln učinek "
"variacije lahkotnosti viden v čopičem, pri 0% pa barve čopiča brez kakršne "
"koli variacije lahkotnosti.  To omogoča spremenljiv impasto učinek s "
"ščetkami za lahkotnost, in za spremembo v ščetkah za znamko tekstura, ki "
"uporabljajo konico s ščetko, ki omogoča lahkotnost."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:83
msgid "Scatter"
msgstr "Raztresi"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:85
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This parameter allows you to set the random placing of a brush-dab. You can "
"affect them with Sensors."
msgstr ""
"Ta parameter vam omogoča, da nastavite naključno dajanje čopiča-dab. Nanje "
"lahko vplivate s Senzorji."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:87
msgid "X"
msgstr "X"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:88
msgid "The scattering on the angle you are drawing from."
msgstr "Raztresanje po kotu, iz katerega rišete."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:90
msgid "Y"
msgstr "Y"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:90
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The scattering, perpendicular to the drawing angle (has the most effect)."
msgstr "Raztresenost, pravokotna na kot risbe (ima največ učinka)."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:93
msgid ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_2_9_brushengine_scatter.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_2_9_brushengine_scatter.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:97
msgid "Sharpness"
msgstr "Ostrina"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:100
msgid ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_Pixel_Brush_Settings_Sharpness.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_Pixel_Brush_Settings_Sharpness.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:101
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Puts a threshold filter over the brush mask. This can be used for brush like "
"strokes, but it also makes for good pixel art brushes."
msgstr ""
"Postavi filter praga nad masko čopiča. To lahko uporabljamo za čopiče kot "
"poteze, vendar pa tudi za dobre piksel art čopiče."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:103
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Jakost"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:104
#, fuzzy
msgid "Controls the threshold, and can be controlled by the sensors below."
msgstr "Nadzoruje prag in ga lahko nadzorujejo spodnji senzorji."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:106
msgid "Soften Edge"
msgstr "Zmehčaj rob"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:106
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Controls the extra non-fully opaque pixels. This adds a little softness to "
"the stroke."
msgstr ""
"Nadzoruje dodatne nespolno nepregledne piksle. To doda malo mehkobo za "
"možgansko kap."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:110
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The sensors now control the threshold instead of the subpixel precision, "
"softness slider was added."
msgstr ""
"Senzorji zdaj nadzorujejo prag namesto natančnosti podpiksel, je bil dodan "
"drsnik mehkobe."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:114
msgid ""
"Whether to have the brush outline align to the pixel grid. This is useful "
"with some forms of pixel art."
msgstr ""
"Ali naj se oris čopiča poravna z mrežo slikovnih točk. To je uporabno pri "
"nekaterih oblikah risanja slikovnih točk."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:116
msgid "Align the brush preview outline to the pixel grid."
msgstr "Poravnajte obris predogleda čopiča na mrežo slikovnih točk."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:121
msgid "Size"
msgstr "Velikost"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:124
msgid ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_Pixel_Brush_Settings_Size.png"
msgstr ".. image:: images/brushes/Krita_Pixel_Brush_Settings_Size.png"

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:125
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This parameter is not the diameter itself, but rather the curve for how it's "
"affected."
msgstr "Ta parameter ni premer sam, ampak krivuja, kako je prizadeta."

#: ../../reference_manual/brushes/brush_settings/options.rst:127
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"So, if you want to lock the diameter of the brush, lock the Brush tip. "
"Locking the size parameter will only lock this curve. Allowing this curve to "
"be affected by the Sensors can be very useful to get the right kind of "
"brush. For example, if you have trouble drawing fine lines, try to use a "
"concave curve set to pressure. That way you'll have to press hard for thick "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"Torej, če želite zakleniti premer čopiča, zaklenite konico čopiča. "
"Zaklepanje parametra velikosti bo samo to krivuljo. Omogočanje, da to "
"krivuljo vpliva Senzorji je lahko zelo koristno, da bi dobili pravo vrsto "
"čopiča. Če imate na primer težave z risanjem finih črt, poskusite uporabiti "
"konkavno krivulo, nastavljeno na pritisk. Tako boste morali močno pritisniti "
"na debele črte."

